flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8305702Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8306412Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8322751Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8324476Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8324787Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8325491Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8326003Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8326399Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8326949Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8327155Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8327586Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8328174Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8328673Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8329058Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8329237Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8329440Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8329714Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8329931Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8330357Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8330508Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8330627Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8330810Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8331095Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
