flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8331934Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8332151Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8332782Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8333697Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8334667Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8335704Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8336032Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8336339Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8336773Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
