flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8356282Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T09:07:39.8357079Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
